{"baseRefName":"fix/mobile-host-proof","baseRefOid":"c742199bca280c4ceffcfddfa2b41cc4dbf80f39","body":"## Summary\n\nSecurity-audit fixes, stacked on the mobile host-proof branch:\n\n- **Miruro curl leg** — `-L` is gone; redirects are walked in-process with scheme + private-literal + DNS checks on every hop (mirror URLs come from upstream JSON, so hop 0 is remote-controlled — no caller-intent exemption). Headers no longer leak to unchecked redirect targets.\n- **`-q` on every curl spawn** — both the shared transport and the miruro leg now lead with `-q`, so `~/.curlrc` can no longer inject proxy/cert/key flags into provider fetches.\n- **HLS manifest embedded-URI vetting** — `blockedHlsManifestUriReason` scans segment lines and `URI=\"...\"` attributes on the already-fetched manifest text; non-http(s) schemes and private literals report `blocked-target`, which the player boundary treats as terminal rather than falling through to the direct URL. Covers remote-played manifests too, not just materialized ones.\n- **Deferred MPD `<BaseURL>` vetting** — AllManga Ak representation URLs (upstream JSON) get scheme + private-literal checks before the MPD is written; a poisoned target fails materialization instead of reaching mpv.\n- **`isAllowedMpvUrl` local-lane bypass** — `\"local\"` kind widened the scheme set to files AND skipped the private-literal check on http(s); the literal boundary now applies to every network URL.\n- **mpv argv credential exposure** — `--http-header-fields` (CloudFront signed cookies et al.) and `--ytdl-raw-options` (po_token) no longer ride argv, which is world-readable via `/proc/<pid>/cmdline`. They land in an owner-only `--include` conf next to the IPC socket, `%<len>%`-quoted against `#`/`, `/`\"` corruption, deleted once IPC readiness proves mpv's startup parse finished. Verified against mpv 0.41.0 — values read back verbatim.\n- **yt-dlp `--`** — operand boundary before the watch URL, matching the curl convention.\n- **SECURITY.md** — documents the same-origin checksum trust boundary (SHA256SUMS proves transit integrity; GitHub release integrity is the root of trust).\n\n#### Test plan\n\n- [x] Providers suite: 1030 pass incl. new `blockedHlsManifestUriReason` describe, miruro trailer parse, argv-terminator fixture\n- [x] CLI suites: mpv-args-safety (+2 incl. owner-only conf round-trip), deferred-materializer hostile rep URL, persistent-session harness — all green\n- [x] Real mpv 0.41.0 verification of `--include` + `%len%` quoting semantics\n- [x] Anti-slop baseline: 4406 = baseline\n- [x] Pre-push gate: 26 tasks, 5946 unit + 296 integration, 0 fail","files":[{"path":".docs/provider-dossiers/allmanga.md","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":".docs/provider-dossiers/miruro.md","additions":5,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":".docs/providers.md","additions":4,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"SECURITY.md","additions":4,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/src/infra/player/PersistentMpvSession.ts","additions":27,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/src/infra/player/mpv-playback-url.ts","additions":6,"deletions":4,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/src/mpv.ts","additions":118,"deletions":8,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/src/services/playback/deferred-media-materializer.ts","additions":25,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/src/services/playback/hls-manifest-materializer.ts","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/test/unit/infra/player/mpv-args-safety.test.ts","additions":61,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/test/unit/services/playback/deferred-media-materializer.test.ts","additions":23,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/src/miruro/direct.ts","additions":123,"deletions":29,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/src/shared/hls-manifest.ts","additions":50,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/src/shared/provider-http-transport.ts","additions":4,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/src/youtube/yt-dlp-metadata.ts","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/test/curl-argv-terminator.test.ts","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/test/hls-manifest.test.ts","additions":51,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/test/miruro-direct.test.ts","additions":12,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"headRefName":"fix/security-boundaries","headRefOid":"1d4ce5202a32759766b1425396aec988a5e30bcf","mergeable":"MERGEABLE","number":543,"reviewDecision":"","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-02T23:26:00Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kunai/actions/runs/37077535456/job/111070652320","name":"Path filters","startedAt":"2026-10-02T23:25:55Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-02T23:26:10Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kunai/actions/runs/37077535400/job/111070652092","name":"Version ↔ changelog guard","startedAt":"2026-10-02T23:25:56Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release Guard"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-02T23:26:28Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kunai/actions/runs/37077535456/job/111070652565","name":"Format check","startedAt":"2026-10-02T23:25:55Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-02T23:26:22Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kunai/actions/runs/37077535456/job/111070652466","name":"Lint","startedAt":"2026-10-02T23:25:56Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-02T23:26:29Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://githu